@@ -621,6 +621,20 @@ config MMC_SDHCI_MSM
 
 	  If unsure, say N.
 
+config MMC_SD_RETIMER_O2
+	bool "BayHub BH201 SD retimer"
+	depends on MMC_SDHCI_MSM=y
+	help
+	  Support for the BayHub BH201 SD retimer between the SDHCI
+	  controller and the card on the Lenovo Y700 Gen 5 (TB323FU), whose
+	  configuration table the driver carries. The slot runs at 100 MHz.
+	  With the module parameter sd_retimer_o2.calibrate=1 the next card
+	  insertion (or a rebind of the slot) calibrates the retimer's 200 MHz
+	  phase and runs the card at 202 MHz; if no phase reads, it stays at
